{"name":"Saratoga","hex":"#555b2c","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Saratoga","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A number of places in the United States.\nA city in Santa Clara County, California.\n\nA neighbourhood of Omaha, Nebraska, formerly a town also known as Saratoga Springs.\nA town in Saratoga County, New York, adjacent to Saratoga Springs.\nA number of townships in the United States, listed under Saratoga Township.","A city in Santa Clara County, California."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A cocktail resembling a Manhattan, with the base split between rye whiskey and cognac or brandy."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Saratoga"}],"entries":[{"title":"Saratoga, New South Wales","blocks":[{"text":"Saratoga is a residential south-eastern village and suburb of the Central Coast region of New South Wales, Australia, located on a peninsula of Brisbane Water and part of the Central Coast Council local government area. The suburb is characterised by its largely settled shoreline, with houses extending up coastal slopes to the base of the tall hills that comprise the core of the peninsula."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/8/82/Saratoga_nsw.jpg/330px-Saratoga_nsw.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Saratoga%2C_New_South_Wales"},{"title":"Saratoga County, New York","blocks":[{"text":"Saratoga County is a county in the U.S. state of New York, and is the fastest-growing county in Upstate New York. As of the 2020 United States census, the county's population was enumerated at 235,509, its highest decennial count ever and a 7.2% increase from the 219,607 recorded at the 2010 census, representing one of the fastest growth rates in New York. The county seat is Ballston Spa. The county is part of the Capital District region of the state."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/50/Downtown_Saratoga_Springs.jpg/330px-Downtown_Saratoga_Springs.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Saratoga_County%2C_New_York"},{"title":"Saratoga (band)","blocks":[{"text":"Saratoga is a Spanish heavy metal band established in Madrid in 1992 by bassist Niko del Hierro and guitarist Jero Ramiro. Since March 2023, the band's lineup has consisted of del Hierro, Ramiro, Tete Novoa (vocals), and Arnau Martí (drums). The band experienced their biggest success during the tenure of vocalist Leo Jiménez (1999–2006). Since 2014, with the arrival of Novoa, they have seen a resurgence in popularity. Saratoga has released fourteen studio albums, five live records, and four compilations, as well as numerous singles."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/62/Barcelona_Rock_Festival_2017_-_Saratoga.jpg/330px-Barcelona_Rock_Festival_2017_-_Saratoga.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Saratoga_(band)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/a/a7/SaratogaCountySeal.png/120px-SaratogaCountySeal.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/a/a7/SaratogaCountySeal.png/250px-SaratogaCountySeal.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/a/a7/SaratogaCountySeal.png/120px-SaratogaCountySeal.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ASaratogaCountySeal.png"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/18/Verbeck_House%2C_Ballston_Spa%2C_NY.jpg/500px-Verbeck_House%2C_Ballston_Spa%2C_NY.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/18/Verbeck_House